  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「クー・カロア先輩ってひとの話によると、お嬢は家庭科室にいるっぽいんですよね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「急ぎましょう。まずは、お嬢と合流しないと」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-japan-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-japan-maid_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「あのう、転校生の先輩。付きあわせちゃって、すみません。お勉強の邪魔しちゃって……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-japan-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-japan-maid_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「そんなに時間はとらせませんので、まぁ息抜きってことで♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-japan-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-japan-maid_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「はい。お嬢が、大旦那さまに『立派なレディ』と思ってもらえるようにするのが、あたしの目的なので。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-japan-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-japan-maid_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「そのへんの審査、ってか判断？　をお願いしたいんですよね～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-japan-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-japan-maid_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「『大旦那さま』なので、男のひとだから。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「男のひとから見た『立派なレディ』に仕立てあげる必要があるんです、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-japan-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-japan-maid_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「あたし女だからそのへんビミョ～にずれるかもだし」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「まぁ先輩と大旦那さまだと、年齢がちがうからなぁ。あくまで、参考ってことで。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-japan-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-japan-maid_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「先輩が一緒に行動してくれると、何かと頼りになるし～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-japan-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-japan-maid_expression/embarrassed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「どうしました、ジロジロ見て。照れる～。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-japan-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-japan-maid_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「あぁ、このメイド服……ってか『使用人の衣装』は、奥さまがむかし使ってたものらしいんです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「えっと奥さまっていうのは、お嬢のお母さんのことですよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「転校生の先輩には話しましたっけ……。うちは代々、お嬢のおうちに仕える使用人の家系なんです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「むかしは、自分も使用人になるもんだと思ってたから。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-japan-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-japan-maid_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「今でもつい癖で『お嬢』とか『奥さま』とか、時代錯誤な呼びかたしちゃうんですよね～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-japan-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-japan-maid_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「おっと、話が逸れました。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-japan-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-japan-maid_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「えぇっと、奥さまはむかし旦那さま……お嬢のお父さんに仕える使用人だったんですって」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「うちのお母さんも例によって使用人だったので、つまり同僚だったみたいです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「良きライバルで、親友だったみたいですよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-japan-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-japan-maid_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「今でも、お母さんどうしでお茶会したり一緒に遊んだりしてますね～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-japan-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-japan-maid_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「あたしは詳しくないけど、何かすごい大恋愛の果てに奥さまは旦那さまのハートを射止めて……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「身分の差を乗り越えて、玉の輿をゲットしちゃったとか」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「嘘みたいな話でしょ、恋愛小説みたい」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「ともあれ見事、旦那さまに見初められた奥さまは電撃入籍。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「それ以来、使用人の仕事も辞めて今では立派な『奥さま』になってます」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「その奥さまの現役時代の衣装を、『もう使わないから』ってあたしにプレゼントしてくれたんですよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「それが、あたしがいま着てるこれです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「奥さま、お嬢とよく似たフワフワしたゆる～いひとなので。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-japan-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-japan-maid_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「お手紙も何もなかったし、どうしてあたしに衣装を贈ってくれたのかわかんないんですけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-japan-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-japan-maid_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「あたし、これは奥さまからのメッセージだと思うんですよね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「たぶんお嬢を、奥さまの娘を鍛え直してほしいっていう」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「あたし、もともと『そういうこと』がお役目でしたしね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「お嬢のお世話とか、立派なレディになるための教育とか……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-japan-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-japan-maid_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「まぁ、あたしはそのお役目を色々あって放りだしちゃったんですけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「だから今さら、なんですけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「ずっとお嬢を放置しちゃったぶん、ちょっとぐらいは面倒を見てあげてもいいかなって……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「これが正解なのか、わかんない。奥さまの意図を、誤解しちゃってるのかも。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-japan-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-japan-maid_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「でも、あたしは『そうしたい』って思ったんです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「いつまでも、ウジウジ悩んでいても仕方ないし」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「それなら、あたしは行動したい。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「いつもみたいに思いつめてパンクしちゃってたくさん泣いて、後悔するだけかもしれないけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「何もしないで後悔するより、ずっと『まし』だもん」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-japan-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-japan-maid_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「あたしは何度も決断して、そのたびに失敗して後悔して……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「でも今、頭を抱えて蹲っちゃったらほんとに馬鹿みたいだ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「期待を、信頼を、愛情を裏切って歩いてきちゃった。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「今さら振り返っても、元の道に戻ろうとしても遅い。もう、お嬢とはちがう道を歩いてる」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-japan-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-japan-maid_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「だからあたしは、せめて行けるところまで行きたい。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「全力を振り絞って、限界まで走って、振り向くのは倒れちゃってからでいい」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「苦しくてもつらくても、うまくいかなくても、あたしはそれなりに幸せな景色のなかに辿りついたから。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「もっともっと、この青春のなかを駆け回っていたいから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「ひとの心配できるほど、余裕ないけど。でもできれば、たとえちがう道でも。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「お嬢にも同じぐらい幸せな景色が見られるところまで、歩いていってほしい」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-japan-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-japan-maid_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「お嬢が疲れて立ち止まったら、もう手を引いて歩くことはできないけど。その資格も、実力もないけど……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-japan-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-japan-maid_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「『がんばれ』って、声ぐらい送りたいよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「今回は、『そういうこと』なんです。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-japan-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-japan-maid_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「って、すみません。よくわかんない話をしちゃいました、恥ずかし～……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-japan-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-japan-maid_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「先輩、あたしよく話がとっちらかっちゃうんで。意味わかんないこと言ってたら、指摘してくださいね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-japan-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-japan-maid_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「独り言みたいに、とりとめなく喋っちゃったなぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-japan-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-japan-maid_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「まぁ、ともかく。あたし、お嬢を鍛え直そうかなって。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「大旦那さまが怒りださない程度に、『立派なレディ』に仕立てあげたいなって」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「今だけは、この服を着ているときだけは……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「お嬢の使用人として、できるかぎりのことをしてあげる。お節介でも、お嬢がそれを望んでなくても」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「あたし、やり残したことがあるとモヤモヤしちゃうんです。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「この機会に、お役目とか『しがらみ』とかぜんぶ解消して、前へ進みたいんですよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-japan-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-japan-maid_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「全力で、やってみます。それで失敗して駄目だったらもう、あたしのせいじゃないもん。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-japan-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-japan-maid_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「あたしは、やれることはやったって胸を張れる」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「もしうまくいったら、奥さまみたいに使用人の服を脱いで……。」"
  },
  {
